            },
            "": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Unnamed"
            }
          },
          "required": []
        }
      },
      "source": {
        "file": "third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/forms/form_mcp_schema.cc",
        "lines": "1238-1246",
        "url": "https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/refs/tags/154.0.8037.97/third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/forms/form_mcp_schema.cc?format=TEXT"
      },
      "question": "Is a disabled named input included in the declarative schema, and what happens when it is targeted?",
      "answer": "disabledField is absent; targeting it returns Error for an unknown parameter, leaves all inputs unchanged, and does not submit."
