      "question": "Does an unnamed text input appear as an empty-name property, and can empty-name input fill it?",
      "answer": "The schema contains property \"\"; input {\"\":\"unnamed-after\"} fills the DOM control and completes one submit (agentInvoked=true, isTrusted=true); FormData omits it because the control is unnamed."
